SUMMARY:Man Gordan | Salvatore Santiago
LOCATION:Bowery Palace\, East Village
DESCRIPTION:Man Gordan brings emotional indie and alternative rock to the s
 
tage for his first ever full band shows. Expect sad songs played loud\, big
 
 guitars\, and a night that's equal parts emotional and fun. We'll sing tog
 
ether\, smile\, laugh\, and maybe cry a little. These are the first shows o
 
f something new\, and we're incredibly excited to finally share these songs
 
 live. VIP tickets include: Early entry to the venue Access to soundcheck M
 
eet & greet with Man Gordan Photo together Signed poster General admission 
 
to the show included Tickets & info: https://www.ticketweb.com/event/man-go
 
rdan-salvatore-santiago-bowery-palace-tickets/15042613
